acter is a space character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/isblank\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>isblank</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if a character is a blank character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/isprint\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>isprint</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if a character is a printing character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/ispunct\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ispunct</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if a character is a punctuation character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Character_manipulation\">Character manipulation </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/tolower\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tolower</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts a character to lowercase <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/toupper\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>toupper</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts a character to uppercase <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">ASCII values\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">characters\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">\n<p><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/iscntrl\"><code>iscntrl</code></a><br>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/iswcntrl\"><code>iswcntrl</code